{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.hinana.macaron",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "喫茶店的桌子被点心占满",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.hinana.macaron",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.hinana.macaron",
    "idolId": "hinana",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "──嗯～……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "覆盆子马卡龙，还有～草莓、柠檬，……樱桃也要！",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "然后～千层酥和伊斯法罕马卡龙，还有……",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "红茶两杯！麻烦您～",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "呀哈～♡好期待呢～，制作人！",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……雛菜。",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～～～？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "点了挺多量的，吃得完吗……？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶，制作人不也一起吃吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶，原来是这个意思吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "诶～！？因为雛菜说了『一起吃甜的吧～』嘛？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "说『今天也努力了』嘛！",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，确实可能这么说过……",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "嗯～……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "那个～……是什么来着？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "──『多挑战各种事情，拓宽雛菜的可能性吧～！』",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "『我也会一起挑战的！』……是这么说的吧～？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "前阵子，制作人这么说了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？啊，说了是说了……",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "所以我想，先挑战一下没怎么吃过的点心吧～！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "这是那种尝试！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "雛菜…………",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我说的不是那个意思──……",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "可是想一点点尝各种各样的吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "这样能知道更多味道～",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "一点点偷吃，然后决定哪个最幸福",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "甜的东西也好，工作也好，什么都一样！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "所以呢，制作人会陪着雛菜吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "hinana",
        "text": "今后也一直～直，呐？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哈哈，是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我会陪着雛菜，陪到最后。"
      }
    }
  },
